NAME: a repeat around one instruction
DESCRIPTION: (repeat body) loops forever: one ADD and the JMP back per lap; see behtests/repeat_counts.beh
SRC:
(let (n 0)
  (seq
    (repeat (ADD 1 n))
    (DAT 0 (store n))))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

_REP4 
  ADD.AB #1     , $_LET1 
  JMP    $_REP4 , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  DAT    $0     , $0     